{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0513_1000_p", "source_sha256": "288c927cb4fa6c1f4f1a60bc0e1347959b19983d11ed647ee6feafe394084d18", "ja": "（今日はコスプレグラビア企画の撮影日。\n歩は子犬たちと遊んでいるところを撮影する予定だ）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄步和小狗们一起玩耍的样子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0513_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6329662bb06aeec21e08ae4496aa647185ebb629630945655a9eda69705eb33a", "ja": "あっちでトレーナーさんと遊んでる子たちだよね？\n一緒に撮影する子犬って。", "zh": "在那边跟训导员一起玩的就是它们吧？\n要一起拍摄的小狗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0513_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8a082ddd8e88cfebc89b31c88ab95bd95267422eaf09ecd6aeb3adcdff4080d0", "ja": "ああ、そうだよ。\n人には慣れてるみたいだけど、まだやんちゃ……。", "zh": "啊，没错。\n它们好像已经习惯和人相处了，不过还是很调皮……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0513_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "24d3343fed2dd5cd89fff0b90ed99bc5ed3a2e67a5862bcc59486f8d45037392", "ja": "ねぇねぇ{$P$}見てよ！\n目がクリっとして、すっごくカワイイね！", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}你看！\n眼睛圆溜溜的，特别可爱呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0513_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6db4c6c05c89b3081766f3914784fdc293f6018b0915e6ef779da0a28fd5eb77", "ja": "もしかして、あの子たち兄弟かな？　\n顔が似てるような……あはは、仕草までそっくりだよ！", "zh": "难道说，那两个孩子是兄弟？\n长得好像……啊哈哈，连动作都一模一样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0513_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "74ebab4a8f4fdddfae2331327689ce849eecac3d8b6af11a61fcf3607e4a38e8", "ja": "いや～。今日の撮影、楽しみだな～！\n……あれ？　{$P$}、どうしたの？", "zh": "哎呀～今天的拍摄真让人期待啊～！\n……咦？{$P$}，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0513_1007_p", "source_sha256": "78d2a48ace86944ae178096e03bcec208bb69597a28d8f815b915a06f4845ff0", "ja": "なんというか……。\n改めて、その衣装は歩に似合ってるなと思って。", "zh": "该怎么说呢……  \n我只是觉得，重新一看，这身服装真的很适合步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0513_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "39489c901e12f8b765961f16fef5e3f7a038e3dd3f4190af9b2a7d662d420729", "ja": "ええっ！？　ど、どうしたの急に……。\nまぁ、褒めてくれるのは嬉しいけど。", "zh": "诶！？怎、怎么突然说这个……。\n不过，你夸我我还是很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0513_1009_p", "source_sha256": "03f18eeddb0d087c8e5c223e9e942ab55ac2e84d911bcc18a514aa5714a7e446", "ja": "その分なら、撮影も問題ないかもな。\n似た者同士だから、いい写真になりそうだ。", "zh": "照这个状态，拍摄应该也没问题了。\n毕竟是性格相似的人，说不定能拍出很棒的照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0513_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "68b1ac28e37264a371e9367161a9cc9d90731d6b09605a42aadacac6d044771b", "ja": "……ん？　ちょっと待って。\n似た者同士って何？", "zh": "……嗯？等一下。\n什么叫物以类聚啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0513_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a276d5e8a2750fa8b587874b0f34f33b49893c56358fdd22e18c4f146ae7b07c", "ja": "まさか、{$P$}……。\nアタシのこと、犬っぽいって思ってる！？", "zh": "该不会，{$P$}……你觉得我像狗一样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0513_1012_p", "source_sha256": "920712c0ae0ff6677c5bf7d27432b495c95b52fa500b4e8de54e54284f7c752e", "ja": "……少しだけ？\nでも大丈夫！　良い意味で言ったんだ！", "zh": "……就一点点？\n不过没关系！我说的是褒义！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0513_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4c0feca676088ca5f01162e8a75579b5f6927b6f5d618ad01843e6a60469ed3d", "ja": "良い意味……？", "zh": "好的方面……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0513_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b0e7154cc55cbe814d152308fe7d6d932bdd16d97ddd5e5f920b11b4bc4e00ee", "ja": "ああ。歩は、身体能力が高くて、人懐っこいし、\n大型犬みたいなカッコよさもあるからな！", "zh": "啊。步的身体能力很强，又很亲人，\n还有着像大型犬一样帅气的一面嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0513_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3e1cf9ecf284d2d41e285f8ab6619a4c83424a8decd5422e2851781530936eb0", "ja": "……えへ、えへへ。まあ、クールでカッコイイ犬の\nイメージなら、アタシにピッタリかもね。", "zh": "……嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿。嘛，要是帅气又酷酷的狗狗\n形象，搞不好还挺适合我的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0513_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d6a3a42775157535bbad0f31ded7d49ff8a9d328fba338fda04088b9d245f71c", "ja": "よーし！　アタシがリーダーになって、あの子たちと\nビシっと決めちゃうからね！　期待しててよ♪", "zh": "好嘞！就由我来当队长，和那些孩子们一起\n帅气搞定吧！你就好好期待吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
